    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "depth": 0,
      "kind": "section",
      "number": "3",
      "title": "General Requirements",
      "body": "Falchions of any types must:\n● be based on historical sources,\n● reproduce the proportions and curves based on historical sources,\n● match the style of the armor kit of the competitor,\n● be conform to the 9.0 section about pommels and guards,\n● be conform to the Technical Requirements document for weapons.\n\nAll decorations on the falchion must be stylized in accordance with the style of the armor kit of the competitor.\n\nIt is prohibited to decorate a falchion with images that are clearly modern and/or offensive. Any metal part of the falchion must conform to the “Armors and Weapons Aesthetics and Decorations” document.\n\nAny textile or leather part of the falchion must conform to the “Textiles and Leather” document.",
