      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "11.2",
      "title": "Beidanas",
      "body": "Beidanas are a farming tool from the 17th century in Italy. Despite its falchion inspired design, it is not a weapon for combat and therefore not suitable for buhurt.\n\nAll falchions reproducing the designs of a Beidana are Denied.",
